<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id">Micah</book>
  <para style="h">Micah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Micah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Micah</para>
  <para style="mt">Micah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpite ahi Jotham, Ahaz le Hezekiah te ii maan laitakin Moresheth khua mi Micah tungah Topa in hi thupuak pia hi. Samaria le Jerusalem taw kisai in Micah tungah Topa in hi thu teng pualaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />No minamte theampo awng, hi thu za tek vun; simlei tungah a teang theampo awng, hi thu ngai vun! Vaanglianpipa Topa in note langkhat panin tetti pang tu hi. Ngai vun! Ama in a vantung biakinn panin son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in ama ii mun thiangtho pan hong pai tu hi; ama hong tuaksuk tu a, mualte dawn ah vak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ciang meikhuk khat ii sungah khuainun a tuithap bangin mualpite ama ii nuai ah tuitham tu hi; mualno khat tungah tui buaksuk bangin ngamkuamte sungah buaksuk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hite theampo piang tu hi, banghang ziam cile Israel mite maw in, Pathian langpan uh hi. Israel ii langpanna sia akua mawsiat tu ziam? Ngam bup khuapi mama ahi Samaria hi! Akua in Judah ah milim biakna taw maw ahi ziam? Jerusalem ama mama hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Topa in, “Samaria sia ngam taanzauna sung a siasa teng kholna mun, sapitkung ciin natu mun ka suaksak tu hi. A khuapi sungah suangte zongh kuam sungah ka sungsuk tu a, a khuapi tawphate ka lawtsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A milim manpha theampo a bebekin kisunen tu a, biakinn sungah pumpi zuak numeite a kipia nate theampo mei taw kihaltum tu hi, tuaciang a milimte theampo sia a kinusia vuumthuk khat suak tu hi. Samaria in hi nate sia a pungto a sua natu poai vawt natu in a nga uh hi a, tu in a ngalte in tuate sia biakinn sung pumpi kizuakte atu in mundang ah puak tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Micah in, “Hi sia hu in khuangai in ka kap tu hi. Ka heena ka lakna in peangnguak le pumnguakin ka vak kawkoai tu hi. Ngam ui bangin ka au tu a, kalaoh vacim bangin ka tau tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Samaria ii liammate kidamsak thei ngawl tu hi, tuaciang Judah zongh tuabang ma in thuak nai tu hi; suksiatna in ka mite teenna Jerusalem kongpite mama ah hong theng zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gath a om ih ngalte tungah ih ngallelna thu son heak vun; na kaa uh musak heak vun. Beth Leaphrah mite awng, na thinkiamna lakna in leivui sungah kilumliik vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No, Shaphir mite awng, na pumnguak om in maizumin ngamdang ah saltaang tu in pai tavun. Zaanan ah a teangte a khuapi sung pan pusuak ngam ngawl uh hi. Bethezel mite mauna na zaak uh ciang tua munah bukna a om ngawl hunlam na he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maroth mite in huna noptuam a nga natu thinngimin ngak uh hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in Jerusalem nai na ah tuasiatna thengsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />No, Lachish ah a teangte awng, na siphute ngalleangte tungah khit vun. Note in Israel mawna khialna na zui uh a, tuabangin Jerusalem khialsak nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciang tu in Judah mite awng, Moresheth Gath khua mangpha thaak tavun. Israel kumpite in Achzib khua pan huna nga ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mareshah mite awng, na khua hong la tu ngalte khut sungah Topa in no hong aap tu hi. Israel lampuite pai in Adullam suanghawng sungah buu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Judah mite awng, na it patangnote atu in khuangai in na sam uh meet vun. Vaciik bangin lutolin om vun, banghang ziam cile na patangnote sia ngamdang ah salin no kung pan kila tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mutmawklaw liangin thusia a ngealte atu in bangza in lauhuai tu ziam! Amate in zingsangin hunpha a nga pawpo ciang a ngeal sa tatsiatna sia vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in lote a dei uh ciang suttol uh hi; innte a dei uh ciang laksak uh hi. A kuama po ii innkuan, ahibuale neisa bit ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Topa in, “No tungah tuasiatna puak tu in ngeal khi hi, tuaciang note suakta thei ngawl tu nu hi. Ngimnga in na om uh kimu tu nu hi; tuaciang kiphasak in vak nawn ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hun a tun ciang, mite in no sia tuasiatna huvau sonteena in hong nei tu hi, noma thuakna teng khuangai la in na sa tu uh hi: Eite ih lalcip dikdek zo hi! Topa in ih ngam ih lei la zo a, tuaciang ei hong mante tungah tuasia kipia zo hi,” ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabang ahiciang Topa mite tungah leitang a kipiak kik tu hun a thet ciang note kuama atu tel om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mipite in kei tung ah, “Ko, thu hong hil heak in. Tuabang thute hong hil heak in. Pathian in kote hong maimawlsak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mite haamsiatna thuak sa nu ziam? Topa in a thin sausak zo nawn ngawl ziam? Tuabang tatak ma in vawt tu ziam? A maan in a seamte ama in dikna taw paupui hi ngawl ziam?” ci in thu hong hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in, “Noma in ka mite sia ngalte bangin sim nu hi. Pasalte ngalphual pan cia a, inn ah ngam muangin om tu kisa hi, ahihang note tualai ah om in a silh lai laktong puasilhte nguksak tu in na ngak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mite sung pan numeite sia a it a innte pan na hawlkeak tu uh a, a tate tung pan ka thuphate a tawntungin na sut uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tho vun a, pai vun; hi lai ah ngam muanna om nawn ngawl hi. Na mawnate in hi mun siasak in lalna sung then hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Hi mihingte ahile, ‘Sapittui le zu no atu in hong luang tu hi ci in kamsaanna kong son hi’ ci in leilot thu bebek sonin a vak, ngualtheam kamsaang namte, dei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ahihang no Israel mi a taanglai theampo kong kaikhawm tu hi. Tuute a khawk sungah a cia bangin kong khawmtua tu hi. Tuute a dimin a om nganthana mun bangin na ngam sia mihing tam mama taw khatvei kidim kik tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian in amate atu in lampi honsak tu a, a saltanna mun pan suatak tu hi. Amate in khuapi kongpite suthamin suakta tu uh hi. A kumpipa ahi, Topa mama in amate pusuapui tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />No, Israel a ukte awng, ngai vun! Note in thumaan thutang dei tu hong kimuangmaw hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua hi napi, note in a phate ngaimaw in a siate na it uh hi. Ka mite a hingtangin a vun hoai in, a ngute tung pan a sa na sem uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka mite na netum uh hi. A vun hoai in, a ngu siiktanin beal sung huan tu sa bangin na sem uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa tungah na ko tu hun hong theng tu a, ahihang ama in hong zo ngawl tu hi. Note thungetna ama in hong ngai ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile a sia na vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sum a pia zote tungah kilemna om tu hi ci in kamciam pia a, ahihang a pia zo ngawlte tungah ngal om tu hi ci in a tawng kamsaangte ii theamna sia ka mite in thuak hi. Hi kamsaangte tungah Topa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Kamsaangte awng, na ni uh bo dektak hi; no tungah ni tum tu hi. Ka mite lam khialsak na hi uh ciang kamsaan mukholnate na nei nawn buatu uh a, bangma na sonkhol thei nawn buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mailam atu a sonkholte, a son bang a taangtut ngawl hu in minsia tu uh hi. Amate theampo ki enthaw tu hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian in amate ci bangin zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang kei ka hile Topa in a thaa le a vaangletna taw hong dim a, thukhaikim heak theina le Israel mite tungah amate mawna khialna teng son ngam natu hanna hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thukhaikim ngaimaw in, a maan sia a khial a sua, no Israel ngamukte awng, hong ngai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian khuapi Jerusalem sia mihing thalupna le thutan ngawlna tawdap tungah na sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuapi ukte in sumnguk neak natu in uk a, thiampite in thaman nga natu in Thukham pheen a, kamsaangte in sum nga natu in thupualaakna pia hi — a vekpi ma in Topa in amate ompui hi ci tek hi. Amate in “Ko tungah siatna hong theng ngawl tu hi. Topa in ko hong ompui hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom note hu in Zion sia lo khat bangin kitho tu a, Jerusalem sia nin kholna suakin, Biakinnpi mual sia dui suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mailam hun ah Biakinnpi dinna mual sia a saangbel mual khat hi tu a, mualnote theampo tungah dokto tu hi. Minam tam mamate tua munah tuiluang bangin hong pai tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang a mite in, “ Topa ii mual, Israel ii Pathian Biakinnpi ah kaato tawng. Banghang ziam cile seam a hong oaite ama in hong hil tu hi; ama tealsa lampi ih zui tu hi. Banghang ziam cile Topa hilcianna in Jerusalem pan hong pai hi; ama in Zion panin a mite paupui hi,” ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in minamte sung ahizong, a nai a khuala a vaanglian ngamte sungah ahizong, ama in a kituu uh thute lemtua tu hi. Amate in a namsaute lothawna in seak tu a, a teipite thingbaak heuna nam sua tu uh hi. Ngamte ngal kido kik ngei nawn ngawl tu a, ngal kido kik tu in kithoai ngei nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A neisa sapithuante le a theikungte sungah mi theampo kilemin teang tu hi, tuaciang kuama in ama lausak ngawl tu hi. Topa Vaanglianbelpa in hi kamciam pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Minam simin amate tek ii pathian bia in a thu ni hi, ahihang eite in Topa, ih Pathian a tawntung, a tawntungin ih bia tu a, a thu ih ni tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in, “Daan ka piak mite, sal taang in ngim a thuak mite ka khoptua kik tu hun hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate liamin bai a, inn panin kikhuala hi, ahihang a taanglaite atu kipat kikna thak khat ka vawtsak tu a, amate minam lian khat suak tu hi. Amate tua hun pan kipan Zion Mual tung pan a tawntungin ka uk tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang nang Jerusalem, tuucing khat bangin Pathian ii a mite a etcikna mun sia, khatvei ma noma neisa kumpi ngam khuapi suak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Banghang a nging tatakin kap nu ziam? Nausuak tun numei khat bangin banghang thuak nu ziam? Kumpi na nei ngawl uh hang le na thu kikuppuite a thi uh hang ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem mite awng, nausuak tu numei bangin kisaan in tau vun, banghang ziam cile tu in khuapi na nusia tu uh a, ngam taanzau sungah na teang tu uh hi. Babylon ah na pai uh kul tu hi, ahizong tua munah Topa in na ngalte khut sung pan hong hun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minam tam mamate note sim tu in kikhawm zo hi. Amate in, “Jerusalem kisusia nanak tu hi! Hi khuapi a zaancip in ih mu tu hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang hi minamte in Topa ngaisutna sungah a om sia he ngawl uh hi. Lo ante cil tu in a paipui bangin amate daan piak tu in a kikaikhop ahi hunlam amate in phawk ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in, “Jerusalem mite awng, pai vun a, na ngalte daan pia vun! Thikkii a nei le taau peangcin a nei khuital khat za in kong hatsak tu hi. Note in minam tam mamate tuanhpeak in, ngongtatna taw a nga, nei le lamhte keima, leitung buppi ii Topa nong pia tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem mite awng, na ngalkapte khawm vun! Eite hong uumci hi! Amate in Israel lampuipa sim uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in, “Bethlehem Ephrathah khua awng, nang in Judah ngam sungah khuanobel khat na hi a, ahizong nang sung pan Israel a ukpa tu khat ka piangsak tu hi. Ama khang ngui in taangh tawngh pek taw kizom hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom nau nei tu numei nu ii a tapa a pian mateng Topa in a mite sia a ngalte khut sungah a nusia tu hi. Tua zawkciang ngamdang ah saltaang a mipuite sia a mite taw kingawm kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama hong pai ciang, ama in a mite Topa tung pan hong pai thahatna le Topa Pathian mama ii vaang neina taw uk tu hi. A mite ngammuang takin teang tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile leitung bup mihingte in ama ii letna saang thei tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ama in kilemna puak tu hi. Assyria te in ih ngam hong sim a, ih ngalnanna kulh le taapte hong kaantan ciang, amate do tu in a hatbel ih lampuite ih puak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngalhiam tha hatna taw amate in Nimrod ii leitang Assyria sia zothal tu hi, tuaciang Assyria te in ih ngam hong sim ciang amate in eite hong hun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi a suakta laite sia minam tam atu in Topa piak tha thak nga kikna daaitui bang hi tu a, thingno suante tung a nguazu vapeak bang hi tu hi. Amate in Pathian bealh tu a, mihing suang ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minamte sungah a taanglai mite sia duisung ahibuale, ngamsa tatna mun ah, an zong tawpi savai khat bang hi tu hi: ama in tuuhon sungah tum a, tuute manin a bek a bekin laai a — tuaciang suatak natu lametna om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel in a ngalte zothalin susia siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in, “Tua hun ciang, na siphute la in na ngalleangte ka susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na ngam sungah khuapite ka susia tu a, na kidalna theampo ka balkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na zak uh bum le ai theampo ka susia tu a, khutlam en aisaan thei khat zongh ka khoaikhe buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na milimte le na biak suangkhuam thiangthote ka susia tu hi; note in na vawt tawm nate na bia nawn buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na ngam sungah a om numeipathian Asherah milimte ka kaivawk tu a, na khuapite ka susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka thu a ni ngawl minamte theampo tungah thin uukna lianpi taw ka thuk tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa ii Israel te a mawsakna thu ngai vun. Topa awng tho in, na thu sung in; mualpite le mualnote in na son teng zasak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />No mualte le a tawntung a kip no simlei tawdapte awng, Topa thu ngai vun! Topa in a mite mawsak tu hi. Ama in Israel tungah mawsakna khat nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka mite awng, note tungah bang hong vawt zo khi ziam? Note atu bangbangin vanh ngit khat suak zo khi ziam? Hong zo tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Egypt ngam pan kong pusuaksak hi; saltanna pan kong suatak hi; note lam hong pui tu in Moses, Aaron le Miriam kong puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka mite awng, Moab kumpi Balak in note bang law hong sawm a, Beor tapa Balaam in bangbang zo kik ziam cisia phawk kik vun. Acacia ngiaphual pan Gilgal paina lampi ah a piang teng phawk kik vun. Hite phawk kik vun, tua hile note kong ngup natu in ka septe phawk tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vantung Pathian Topa bia tu in ka pai ciang ama atu bang puak tu khi ziam? Biakpiakna a hal tu khuino phabelte paipui tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuu a tul sim ahizong, a bomaw lui bang in a luang Olive thaute ahizong puak leng Topa a lungkim tu ziam? Ka mawphel natu in ka taciil ka pia tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi ngawl hi Topa in thupha hong son zo hi. Ama ii ei tung pan bang hong tangkal thu in hisia hi: a maan sia seam tu, ki itna kip lak tu le, kiniamkhiak in ih Pathian taw kipawl khawmin nuntak tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa kiitakna in ciimna hi. Ama in tua khuapi sam a, “No khuapi sung a kikhawm mite awng, na ngai vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing tatsiate ii inn sungah thumaan ngawlna taw a nga sumngumte om hi. Amate in ka ngaimawk khaikhin maan ngawlte zangh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangbangin khaikhin le toaisuang maan ngawl a zanghte a khialna maisak thei tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mihaute in mizawngte duupkang a, note theampo leilot thusonte na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom, na mawnate hangin a lalsak le a siasak tu in kong kipan zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An na neak uh hang na lungkim buatu uh a — a tatakin na ngil uh kial veve lai tu hi. Vanhte pua in, nate paipui tu na hi uh hang na keamcing zo buatu uh hi. Na top uh vanh pawpo ngal sungah ka susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lo an na ciing tu uh a, ahihang an na la buatu uh hi. Olive ngate sathau suak tu in na ngoai tu uh a, ahihang na zangh ngei buatu uh hi. Sapittui na vawt tu uh a, ahihang na ne ngei buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi bang hong piang tu hi, note in Omri kumpipa le a tapa Ahab kumpipa ii ngamtat siate na zui uh hang ahi hi. Amate ngamtat ziate zomto na hi uh ciang kong siacipsak tu a, a kuama po in note hong zawngsak tu hi. Mite in mun theampo ah note hong zawnsak vawt tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lametna bo hi! Thingnga pangh sa, sapitnga thot sa a vil mihing ngilkial khat taw ka kibang hi. Sapit theampo le theinga lim theampo kilo siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngam sungah thumaan mihing khat zongh taang ngawl a, Pathian tungah kuama thumaan ngawl hi. A kuama po in ngual a thalup thei natu hunpha ngak hi. A kuama po in a mipuite savai bangin vai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate siatna vawt tu thiam siat uh hi. Uliante le thukhenmangte in sumnguk ngen uh hi. Mihing ci thei khat in ama uuk teng amate tungah son a, tuabangin amate vaihawm khawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate sung pan a phabelte le a thumaan belte ngawngawn lopate bangin mannung ngawl uh hi. Pathian in amate a encik kamsaangte tungtawnin amate a kidop natu a hil khol bangin ama in tua mite daan a piak tu ni hong theng zo hi. Tu in amate lungmang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na innpaam ahizong, na ngualtamh ahizong umin muang heak in. Na zi tungah na pauna ngawngawn kidawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi hun sungah tapate in a pate sia a mawmaw bangin vawt tu a, tanute in a nute nalh tu uh hi, mote in a tonupite taw kihau tu a; mihing khat ii ngalte sia ama innkuanpuite ma hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang keima in Topa ka mitsuan tu hi; kei hong ngum tu Pathian kimuang takin ka ngak tu hi. Ka Pathian in kei hong za tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ih ngalte in ei tungah hong oaiaam natu thu om ngawl hi. Ei ih pukvawk zo a, ahihang ih tho kik tu hi. Tu laitak khuazing sungah ih om a, ahihang Topa in khuavak hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eite in Topa tungah ih maw zo hi, tua ahikom tu in ama ii thin uuk tutna tawmvei ih thuak kul tu hi. Ahihang a tawpna ah ama in eite hong dal tu a, ei tungah hong kitat khialnate a maan taw hong laihsak tu hi. Ama in khuavak sung hong then tu a; hong ngupna ih mu dong ih nungta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuasia ciang ih ngalte in hi sia mu tu a, kimaimawlsak tu hi — tua ngalte in “ Topa na Pathian uh koisung a om ziam?” ci in hong tawtawte ma hi tu hi. Amate ngallelna, lamlai ah buan bangin a kitotcil nate ih mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem mite awng, khuapi luphungte cian kik tu hun hong theng tu hi. Tua hun ciang na ngam kikeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mite mun theampo pan — nisuana sang Assyria pan, thangsang Egypt pan, Euphrates ngamkhen sung pan, tuipi ngalkhat pan le mual khualanate pan no kungah hong heak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang tua leitang sia a tungah a teangte ngitlo seksol hu in sennealngam suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa awng, na tealsa na mite tungah tuucing khat hong hi ta'n. Amate in duisung ngampa ah a tuatuamin teang hikale, a kiimkot ah leihoi leipha om hi. Nidang tawngh lai, a kivaak bangin lohing tamna ngam phana Bashan le Gilead ah amate paisak in kivaak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa awng, Egypt pan nong pusuasak lai hun a na vawt bangin kote atu in nalamdangte vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngam tuatuamte in hi sia mu tu a, a thahatna theampo kawm pan a thin lal tu uh hi. Thin kiamin lungmang a, amate a kam im in, a bilte hum tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate leivui sungah ngulte bangin bokvak tu uh a; a kulhpite pan liingin lauin hong pai tu uh hi. Amate in Topa ih Pathian kungah kiitakna taw hong heak kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa awng, nang bang ahi pathian dang om ngawl hi, a nungta lai na mite ii mawnate na maisak hi. A tawntungin thin uukin na om bua a, na itna kip nong lak sia nuam na sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangma in kote khatvei ma nong hesuak kik tu hi. Kote ii mawna khialnate na peang nuai ah na siikcip tu a, tuipi taw ah na khiasuk tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Taanghlai koma ii taanghpupite tungah na kamciam bangin Abraham le Jacob ii suan le paal na mite tungah na thumaanna le tatsat ngawl na itna na lak tu hi.
  </para>
</usx>
